# Always push to main

When feature work for this repo is complete (or the user asks to ship changes):

- Commit the relevant changes
- Push to `main` / `origin` without asking for confirmation
- Do not wait for an extra "yes, push" — push is pre-approved

Still follow normal git safety: no force-push to main/master, no skipping hooks, no amending pushed commits unless explicitly requested, and do not commit secrets.
